  "details": "<p>The site of Tabo was part of the Kushite kingdom. It is located in the southern part of Argo Island, south of Kerma, some 40 km north of Dongola. A well-preserved temple of Amun measuring ca.\u00a0<span>75.6\u00a0</span>metres<span>\u00a0(248\u00a0ft) long and 31\u00a0</span>meters<span>\u00a0(102\u00a0ft) is found at the site. This is one of the largest known temples in Nubia.</span></p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A Kushite site located on Argo Island in Nubia, the location of a large Amun temple.",
